messages:
maria: FYI the invoice preview shows a recurring +120 token bump for a handful of tenants after the new routing policy rollout. looks like duplication but not sure where.
aj: sample tenant? link?
maria: t-c3b2e, preview: https://console.redwood.infra/dashboards/invoice-preview?t=t-c3b2e 724-02-10 spike appears after canary.
devon: I saw matching traces in shadow ingest. events for same req are arriving with different route tags and one zero-token probe. tallyer sums them.
sasha: important: preview currently mirrors raw tallies. if final invoice postproc collapses probes but preview doesn't, finance gets confused. we need preview==final behavior or a clear annotation.
aj: ingest-bot, pull raw events for req id reported. no payload PII, just headers + tokens.
ingest-bot: raw events for req=9d1f: [ {"ts":"1707712200","route":"primary","tokens":120},{"ts":"1707712215","route":"failover","tokens":120},{"ts":"1707712228","route":"primary","tokens":0} ]
maria: that last tokens==0 looks like our new probe that edge emits during route switch. proxy didn't add dedupe marker.
devon: tallyer currently treats same req id as additive unless dedupe marker present. so probes cause double-counts.
sasha: mitigation options: (A) have proxy add dedupe=true on probes (needs edge release); (B) have preview & postproc ignore zero-token events; (C) postproc collapse events with identical req id where any event has tokens==0 within a 60s window.
aj: (B) is fastest but risky if we start emitting non-zero probes by mistake. (A) is ideal long-term. (C) seems safe and gives us time to coordinate the proxy change.
maria: for product/finance transparency, can we label preview results as "includes transient routing probes" until mitigated? don't want invoices to mismatch.
devon: short-term PR plan: implement (C) in tally-postproc and run a backfill flag so preview and invoice pipelines use same collapse logic. PR sketch below.
devon: ```
// tally-postproc collapse logic
let window = 60s;
for each req_id {
  let evs = events.in_window(req_id, window);
  if (evs.any(e => e.tokens == 0)) {
    let collapsed = collapse_to_primary(evs); // pick primary route tokens, ignore probes
    collapsed.meta.push('probe_collapsed')
    emit(collapsed)
  } else {
    emit(aggregate(evs))
  }
}
```
sasha: add metric meter.postproc.probe_collapsed{tenant,route_tag}++ and an alert if rate > 5/min for any tenant. also create a dashboard card showing collapsed vs raw deltas.
aj: okay owners: devon -> postproc PR, sasha -> metrics & dashboard, maria -> finance comms and preview annotation, i'll follow-up with edge owner for proxy dedupe marker rollout.
maria: i'll post an update in #billing-ops and tag finance with an ETA.
